    <requirement>
        <location>/app/code/expression/effect/option.py</location>
        <description>The OptionBuilder class has incorrect handling of async generators. Tests show TypeError: object Option can't be used in 'await' expression, indicating that async generators are being incorrectly treated as if they need to be awaited in a sync context.</description>
